				<div class="tribe-events-calendar-list__event-description tribe-common-b2 tribe-common-a11y-hidden">
	<p>MANETTI SHREM MUSEUM. The Oakland-based artist is inspired by familial and global histories, food, music, and mourning. The exhibition features a reconfigured clock tower sculpture that alludes to market structures in the Eastern Mediterranean Levant region, and new works in ceramic and bronze that speak to familial and cultural ties across time. Free</p>
